==============================================================================
D. 'TWI' IS A MONOTONIC FUNCTION OF SLOPE
==============================================================================
  Spearman rho(slope, twi) on 1,000,000 random land cells = -1.0000000000
  01b_derive_advanced_features.py: sca = dx*dy / tan(b);  twi = ln(sca / tan(b))
  => twi = ln(dx*dy) - 2 ln(tan b): no upslope contributing area is used at all.

